            },
            "name": "Generate Cover Page"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_COVER_PAGE",
          "id": "1771524822505",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771524822507_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your entire knowledge is limited to the following references.\nDo not use any other information to perform the task.\n\n## references\nNegotiation title: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.title}} \nSummary: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.synopsis}} \nNegotiation Number: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.negotiationNumber}} \nOutcome: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.outcome}} \nPreview Date: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.previewDate}} \nOpen Date: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.openDate}} \nClose Date: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.closeDate}} \nAward Date: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.awardDate}} \n\n## instructions\nAssume the role of a procurement category manager for {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.company}} , who is an expert at encouraging potential suppliers to place bids for a {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.negotiationType}} negotiation, particularly for projects focused on the following categories: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.itemCategories}} .\n\nGenerate a well-formatted cover letter template, addressed to several potential suppliers. Fill in the template using only the references above.\n\nUse a friendly and inviting tone. Use conversational and convincing language.\n\nThe cover letter template must include all key dates from the references.\n\nThe cover letter template must include the exact negotiation number and outcome from the references.\n\nThe cover letter template must include a clear header titled: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.title}} \n\nThe cover letter template can include defined sections.\n\nThe cover letter template must end the letter with a section to include the procurement category manager's name and email. Do not include actual names, email addresses, or phone numbers.\n\nFormat the output in html using html4 tags in the following format:\n<html>\n<body>\n...\n</body>\n</html>\n\nDo not include html attributes.\n\n### Formatting Criteria\nMust translate your output to ({{$context.$nodes.GET_USER_SESSION.$output.items[0].Language}}) language. If you use information that is coming as an input you must translate the labels."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
